    id: 'it-relocation',
    title: 'IT Relocation Services',
    shortDescription: 'Professional IT infrastructure relocation with minimal downtime and maximum efficiency.',
    fullDescription: 'Moving your business doesn\'t have to mean disrupting your operations. Our comprehensive IT relocation services ensure a smooth transition of your entire IT infrastructure to a new location. We handle everything from planning and packing to reinstallation and testing, minimizing downtime and getting you back to business quickly.',
